---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#F70188" />
    <title>Lifitness Dakar — Transformez votre corps. Libérez votre puissance.</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Club de fitness premium multi-salles à Dakar : musculation, boxe, EMS, aquatique, cours collectifs et sauna. 1 abonnement = 2 salles."
    />
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-dark-primary font-sans text-light-primary">
    <main class="mx-auto flex max-w-3xl flex-col items-center gap-8 px-6 py-24 text-center">
      <img
        src="/logo/lifitness-logo-full.svg"
        alt="Lifitness Dakar"
        width="320"
        height="80"
        class="w-64"
      />
      <p class="font-mono text-sm tracking-widest text-brand-cyan uppercase">
        Phase 1 — Setup OK
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold sm:text-5xl">
        Transformez votre corps.
        <br />
        <span class="text-gradient">Libérez votre puissance.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="max-w-xl text-light-primary/70">
        Le socle technique est en place : Astro + Tailwind v4 + TypeScript
        strict, polices self-hosted, palette de marque. La Phase 2 (fondations :
        layout, header, footer, composants UI) arrive.
      </p>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-light-primary/40">
        1 abonnement = 2 salles · Almadies · Sacré-Cœur 3
      </p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
